      "text": "-- payé dans l'exercice, au mois payé\nWHERE deb.DEB_TYPE = 'PM'\n  AND deb.DEB_STATUT IN ('D', 'P')\n  AND deb.DEB_DATE_EFFET >= debut\n  AND deb.DEB_DATE_EFFET <  fin + 1",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-- payé dans l'exercice, au mois payé\nWHERE deb.DEB_TYPE = 'PM'\n  AND deb.DEB_STATUT IN ('D', 'P')\n  AND deb.DEB_DATE_EFFET >= debut\n  AND deb.DEB_DATE_EFFET <  fin + 1",
